        ecrm:P3_has_note    "This sleeveless overgarment for a woman would have been worn over court robes - elegant formal dress for aristocratic occasions. It has a dark velvet trim, to which brass studs have been applied. The heavy multi-coloured fringe makes it full-length."@en ;
